# Customer accounts now use self-owned Better Auth (email sign-in code),
# which is same-origin and needs NO public build-time key.
#
# Runtime secrets live in Cloudflare Pages env (not here):
#   BETTER_AUTH_SECRET     random 32+ char string
#   BETTER_AUTH_URL        https://adrianrasmussen.com
#   RESEND_API_KEY         existing (already set)
#   RESEND_FROM_EMAIL      noreply@adrianrasmussen.com
#   GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID       Google OAuth client ID
#   GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET   Google OAuth client secret
#
# (The old Clerk publishable key was removed when login moved in-house.)
